@baseUrl = http://localhost:3012
@apiKey = d4ad57c970c464a0de00b5b362a3a1164a7657110082f2b9ac28f4f551cdb360
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN_FROM_AUTH_CALLBACK

### KPIs — counts per status + summed amount (defaults to the last 6 months)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/kpis
x-internal-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### KPIs, scoped to one company and an explicit period
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/kpis?companyId=REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID&dateFrom=2026-01-01&dateTo=2026-01-31
x-internal-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Monthly trend — approved / rejected / no-rule per month, empty months included
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/monthly-trend?months=6
x-internal-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Company distribution — top 3 companies + an aggregated "Outras" entry
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/company-distribution?limit=4
x-internal-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recent activity — most recently approved/rejected purchase orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/recent-activity?limit=6
x-internal-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tenant isolation check — an OWNER asking for a company it is not a member of must get 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/kpis?companyId=REPLACE_WITH_FOREIGN_COMPANY_ID
x-internal-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
